-- ---- s 714 ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER, inquiry IS A BOOLEAN, ability IS A BOOLEAN, prospects IS A BOOLEAN, liabilities IS A BOOLEAN, form IS A BOOLEAN, info IS A BOOLEAN, annexed IS A BOOLEAN, ra IS A BOOLEAN, rb IS A BOOLEAN, rc IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 714(1) directors' statement`
`fixture: a statement` MEANS `s 714(1) directors' statement` WITH
    `s 714(1) the amount of the permissible capital payment the statement specifies` IS amount
    `s 714(3) the statement says the directors made full inquiry into the affairs and prospects of the company and formed the opinion` IS inquiry
    `s 714(3)(a) the statement says the opinion is that, as regards its initial situation immediately following the date on which the payment out of capital is proposed to be made, there will be no grounds on which the company could then be found unable to pay its debts` IS ability
    `s 714(3)(b) the statement says the opinion is that, as regards its prospects for the year immediately following that date, the company will be able to continue to carry on business as a going concern throughout that year` IS prospects
    `s 714(4) in forming their opinion under subsection (3)(a) the directors took into account all of the company's liabilities (including any contingent or prospective liabilities)` IS liabilities
    `s 714(5) the statement is in the prescribed form` IS form
    `s 714(5) the statement contains the prescribed information with respect to the nature of the company's business` IS info
    `s 714(6) a report addressed to the directors by the company's auditor is annexed to the statement` IS annexed
    `s 714(6)(a) the report states that the auditor has inquired into the company's state of affairs` IS ra
    `s 714(6)(b) the report states that the amount specified as the permissible capital payment is in his view properly determined in accordance with sections 710 to 712` IS rb
    `s 714(6)(c) the report states that he is not aware of anything to indicate that the opinion expressed by the directors as to any of the matters mentioned in subsection (3) is unreasonable in all the circumstances` IS rc

-- arguments: the amount specified, inquiry, (3)(a), (3)(b), (4) liabilities, prescribed form, prescribed information, report annexed, (6)(a), (6)(b), (6)(c)
#ASSERT `s 714(2) the statement specifies the amount of the permissible capital payment` (`fixture: a statement` 500 TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE) 500 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 714(2) the statement specifies the amount of the permissible capital payment` (`fixture: a statement` 501 TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE) 500 EQUALS JUST FALSE
